      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "# dsh-ask-peer bundle layer. The row is inserted over the base profile; later\n# layers (profile cordis.patch.yml, home patch, --patch overlays) win per row\n# and replace the whole `config` value, so restate every key you need.\n- insert:\n    - id: ask-peer\n      name: dsh-ask-peer\n      config:\n        callerName: 'local'\n        description: ''\n        tags: []\n        rosterRefreshMs: 60000\n        listen: false\n        listenHost: '127.0.0.1'\n        listenPort: 3877\n        requireToken: true\n        workspace: '.'\n        timeoutMs: 120000\n        maxAnswerChars: 48000\n        approvalTimeoutMs: 120000\n        allowExecution: false\n        peers: []\n"
    }
